  <XenotypeDef>
    <defName>omw_fluxspawn_flicker</defName>
    <label>fluxspawn flicker</label>
    <description>Beneath the shadowed undercrofts of samhaphage nests, where psychic death of soul-threads pulse like dying fireflies along cavern walls, the fluxspawn thrive in fetid vats of nutrient slurry. These are no ordinary vermin, they are small, grotesque slugs the size of a colonist's fist. Their bodies are a mottled slurry of iridescent flesh pocked with tumorous gene-pods that twitch and split at random. Ugly doesn't begin to cover it: slick, asymmetrical, perpetually oozing a thin mucus that smells faintly of ozone and regret. Yet slice one open, sear it quick over a chemfuel flame, and the flavor explodes: rich umami undercut by electric tang, like eating a thunderstorm marinated in aged cheese.\n\nThis fluxspawn seems more aggressive than normal and has wings.</description>
    <descriptionShort>This fluxspawn seems more aggressive than normal and has wings.</descriptionShort>
    <iconPath>UI/Icons/Xenotypes/Other</iconPath>
